<body><main><small>THE GLASS SAUSAGE FACTORY / GEOMETRY LABORATORY / SANDBOXED</small><h1>Whirligig · R/Q</h1><p>The bar's rotating sweep plane finds contacts on R and Q in east/west hemispheres. A GrAnn selected-contact carrier constrains the rolling sphere through P_ivot on the outer torus wall and Donomphulon on the inner wall. The sliding crossbar carries one perpendicular tracing elbow, whose wall intersection generates the composite <i>Curvy Lisa</i> trace.</p>
