function gcd(a,b){while(b){let k=a%b;a=b;b=k}return a}
function lcm(a,b){return a/gcd(a,b)*b}
// Equal-area spherical Analemma: two antipodal polar lobes, E crossing, W kiss.
// The shape is an explicit mechanical ansatz, not a solar ephemeris.
function analemmaBeta(t){return ANALEMMA_K*Math.sin(t)*Math.cos(t)**2}
function analemmaBetaP(t){const s=Math.sin(t),c=Math.cos(t);return ANALEMMA_K*c*(1-3*s*s)}
function analemmaBetaPP(t){const s=Math.sin(t);return ANALEMMA_K*s*(9*s*s-7)}
function analemma(t){
 const b=analemmaBeta(t),p=2*t;
 return [Math.cos(b)*Math.cos(p),Math.cos(b)*Math.sin(p),Math.sin(b)];
}
function analemmaFrame(t){
 const b=analemmaBeta(t),bp=analemmaBetaP(t),bpp=analemmaBetaPP(t),p=2*t,
  sb=Math.sin(b),cb=Math.cos(b),sp=Math.sin(p),cp=Math.cos(p),g=analemma(t),
  eBeta=[-sb*cp,-sb*sp,cb],ePhi=[-sp,cp,0],
  v1=add(mul(eBeta,bp),mul(ePhi,2*cb)),
  v2=add(add(mul(eBeta,bpp+4*sb*cb),mul(ePhi,-4*bp*sb)),
         mul(g,-(bp*bp+4*cb*cb))),
  speed=norm(v1),tangent=unit(v1),h=cross(g,tangent),
  kg=dot(g,cross(v1,v2))/(speed**3);
 return{g,t:tangent,h,kg};
}
function analemmaSpeed(t){return Math.hypot(analemmaBetaP(t),2*Math.cos(analemmaBeta(t)))}
function arcLength(N=1536){
 const dt=TWO/N;let sum=0,prev=analemmaSpeed(0);
 for(let i=1;i<=N;i++){const t=i*dt,mid=analemmaSpeed(t-dt/2),next=analemmaSpeed(t);
  sum+=dt*(prev+4*mid+next)/6;prev=next}
 return sum;
}
function buildCam(c){
 const delta=c.major/c.minor-1,cycles=ANALEMMA_CIRCUITS,
  target=TWO*delta/cycles,n=1536,angles=[0],arc=[0],dt=TWO/n;
 if(Math.abs(target-ANALEMMA_UNIT_LENGTH)>2e-10)
  throw Error('Major radius is not locked to the equal-area Analemma gear');
 let prev=analemmaSpeed(0);
 for(let i=1;i<=n;i++){const t=i*dt,next=analemmaSpeed(t);
  angles.push(t);arc.push(arc[i-1]+dt*(prev+4*analemmaSpeed(t-dt/2)+next)/6);prev=next}
 const L=arc[n];
 if(Math.abs(L-ANALEMMA_UNIT_LENGTH)>2e-10)
  throw Error('Numerical Analemma length disagrees with the locked gear constant');
 function at(psi){
  let s=(delta*psi)%L;if(s<0)s+=L;if(s<1e-10||s>L-1e-10)s=0;
  let i=0,j=n;while(j-i>1){const k=(i+j)>>1;if(arc[k]<=s)i=k;else j=k}
  const t0=angles[i],t1=angles[j],v0=analemmaSpeed(t0);
  let t=t0+(t1-t0)*(s-arc[i])/(arc[j]-arc[i]);
  for(let k=0;k<4;k++){
   const d=t-t0,integral=d*(v0+4*analemmaSpeed((t0+t)/2)+analemmaSpeed(t))/6;
   t=Math.max(t0,Math.min(t1,t-(arc[i]+integral-s)/Math.max(1e-12,analemmaSpeed(t))));
  }
